The RAWMEN playtest is starting in one fn hour!

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/34437195/fa2f35ca3bf27e76479c255356e2812000a3de4c.gif

Getchur spoon and line the hell up! The start time is: 

11am PT / 2pm ET / 8pm CET

Everyone who requested the access will be invited during the next hour! If you still haven't requested the access — just go ahead and press the button, and you will still make it, soupsta boy:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/782940/RAWMEN_Food_Fighter_Arena/

A reminder: we released a fresh patch yesterday. Here's the list of changes while it's still hot:

General

 Reworked post-match experience;
 Added “Victory” and “Defeat” messaging events to end of match;
 Added new post-match MVP animations;
 Various team balancing adjustments made;
 Added ball bumpers and bouncers to the Coliseum map;
 Added Speed Boosters to El Pueblito and Coliseum;
 Updated the Boba Blaster weapon model and textures;

Boba Ball

 Increased the ball size by 2.5x;
 Increased the ball gravity 2.5x to prevent indefinite ball airtime with consecutive shots;
 Removed kill scoring and restricted points to goal scores;
 Added team color tracers to Boba Blaster weapon;
 Increased ball suction around Boba Ball goals;

Bug Fixes

 Twitch integration re-enabled in Private matches;
 Player spawning tweaked to prevent spawn camping in various team game modes;
 Added a hard squad cap to 4 players (woops);
 Lobby team balancing revisions.


See y'all in 60 minutes!

